expected|PASS: Anticipated delivery is explicitly not guaranteed, and the negative arrival example preserves the distinction. Adjective placement is checked without treating the passive verb as a new unsupported POS.
list|PASS: Written set as noun and enumeration as verb retain source ordinals and do not imply importance ranking. Packing inventory and catalogue image examples are distinct; of/on/as constructions remain learner-facing.
renew|PASS: Continuing validity and reviving an interest are separate transitive boundaries. Membership procedure is not claimed as law; the atlas and unfinished-project examples preserve before and renewed attention in Vietnamese.
skull|PASS: The bony head structure is distinct from the whole head. A drawing study avoids diagnostic or protective-health promises; Vietnamese hộp sọ and xương sọ are suitable standalone glosses.
we|REVIEW: Speaker-plus-others is the supplied subject pronoun; us is explicitly object form. The you outside we example supports chúng tôi; inclusive/exclusive context and pronoun identity remain owner-review obligations.
